Package: MR.rr
Title: Reduced-Rank Mendelian Randomization with Multiple Exposures and Outcomes
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person(
        "Yuexiang", "Peng",
        email = "peng.1276@osu.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
      ),
      person(
        "Zhihong", "Zhang",
        email = "zhilongz@tamu.edu",
        role = "aut"
      )
    )
Description: Implements reduced-rank Mendelian randomization methods for
    estimating a low-rank causal effect matrix from summary-level genetic
    association data with multiple exposures and multiple outcomes. Methods
    include naive, measurement-error-corrected, spectrally regularized, and
    sparse estimators, together with rank selection and post-selection
    refitting.
